OL,3,GNEWSAThe hospital bosses criticised in
OL,4,ALetby inquiry report
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen the Thirlwall Inquiry published
OL,7,Fits long-awaited findings into Lucy
OL,8,FLetby's crimes this week, the actions
OL,9,Fof NHS leaders responsible for
OL,10,Foverseeing the Countess of Chester
OL,11,Fhospital's neonatal unit - where babies
OL,12,Fhad died or collapsed unexpectedly -
OL,13,Fwere scrutinised.
OL,15,FThe report painted a deeply critical
OL,16,Fpicture of how concerns raised by
OL,17,Fclinicians were handled, concluding
OL,18,Fthat some managers were unwilling to
OL,19,Faccept the possibility that a nurse
OL,20,Fcould be deliberately harming babies.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
