OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAThe hospital bosses criticised in
OL,4,ALetby inquiry report
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere was some criticism of senior
OL,7,Fdoctors, too, for not escalating
OL,8,Fspecific worries sooner.
OL,10,FThirlwall describes a "dysfunctional
OL,11,Fmanagement and governance, a gulf
OL,12,Fbetween hospital leadership and
OL,13,Fclinicians, and a failure to understand
OL,14,Fthe fundamentals of safeguarding".
